// step first updates the velocity from the pull of gravity, then the position
// from the new velocity. Doing it in that order keeps the orbit from slowly
// spiralling in or out. Whole numbers only, so positions are in thousandths
// of a canvas unit and velocities in hundred-thousandths per time unit; a
// step is 3 time units.
//
